# Windows Public Beta Regression — 2026-10-31

Environment : Windows 11 10.0.26200 x64
Node        : v24.14.0
npm         : 11.9.0
pnpm        : 10.34.5
Browser     : system Chrome (Playwright channel=chrome)
Branch      : work/zcode-beta-20261031-20261031T013704Z
Baseline RC : 401dbcee7be316300bf26375d6eec41a754f8bc2 (origin/rc/sonic-20261031)
Code commit : 1cc1ac86548f7700db649a08b70f4fbbbce0f79b
UTC         : 2026-10-31T02:41:48Z

## 1. Pre-fix reproduction (same worktree, built dist)

Mock fixtures: 9307 -> 404, 9308 -> 503 + X-Sonic-Degraded, 9306 -> 200 headers then no body.

- playback 404 : PASS — error toast shown, page still usable.
- playback 503 : FAIL — toast showed generic "This audio source is unavailable;
                 try another track" instead of the degraded reason.
- hanging 9306 : FAIL — no alert after 25 s; audio.play() stayed pending and
                 store isLoading stayed true (infinite loading).

Command:
E2E_CHANNEL=chrome pnpm --dir player exec playwright test e2e/specs/resilience.spec.ts --grep "播放 (404|503)"
Result: 1 failed, 1 passed.

Command:
E2E_CHANNEL=chrome pnpm --dir player exec playwright test e2e/specs/resilience.spec.ts --grep "挂起"
Result: 1 failed (alert not found after 25 s).

## 2. Fix verified

- 15 s startup watchdog aborts the pending media load, increments playbackGeneration,
  pauses the element, clears isLoading and shows a retryable network error.
- Toast throttle key now includes the concrete message, so the 503 degraded reason
  replaces the generic toast instead of being suppressed.
- 404 / 503 / hanging fixtures added to player/e2e/mock-server.mjs.
- Route smoke spec added: 12 main routes, sidebar switching, 404 route, no login entry.

Post-fix targeted:
E2E_CHANNEL=chrome pnpm --dir player exec playwright test e2e/specs/resilience.spec.ts
Result: 13 passed (includes 404, 503, hanging timeout).

E2E_CHANNEL=chrome pnpm --dir player exec playwright test e2e/specs/routes.spec.ts
Result: 15 passed.

